{'symbol': 'DOW', 'date': '2021-05-07 08:00:00', 'title': 'DOW ADVANCES TO #19 ON 2021 TOP 50 COMPANIES FOR DIVERSITY LIST', 'text': "MIDLAND, MICH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--DOW (NYSE: DOW) ADVANCED TO THE 19TH PLACE ON THE 2021 DIVERSITYINC TOP 50 COMPANIES FOR DIVERSITY LIST, WHICH WAS ANNOUNCED YESTERDAY AT A VIRTUAL EVENT HOSTED BY DIVERSITYINC. DOW'S PLACEMENT ON THE LIST FOR THE FOURTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR SHOWCASES THE COMPANY'S CONTINUED ACCELERATION OF ACTIONS AND STRENGTHENING OF INCLUSION AND DIVERSITY (I&D) ACROSS THE ORGANIZATION. DOW WAS ALSO INCLUDED ON 3 OF DIVERSITYINC'S SPECIALTY LISTS: 2ND ON TOP COMPANIES FOR EMP"}